      "raw": {
        "product": {
          "body_html": "<p>The Vermont Frost Series variety pack includes eight 4 fl oz jars of glazes. Vermont Frost glazes transform your pottery with the ethereal beauty of frozen surfaces. Inspired by the legendary Chinese Guan Ware of the Southern Song dynasty, these glazes develop a delicate network of fine cracks — known as crazing — that creates a stunning, crystalline ice effect on every piece. Applied to dark or buff-colored clay bodies, Vermont Frost reveals its full drama: a frosted, snowflake-patterned surface that naturally follows and emphasizes the curves, edges, and contours of your form. Fire to cone 5–6, then wait a day or two for the crackle to fully bloom — the result is a glaze that doesn't just finish your work, it completes it.</p>",
